  "Info": {
    "Name": "Onda Dark",
    "Version": 1.0,
    "Author": "Duong Dieu Phap",
    "Description": "Onda Dark uses deep charcoal surfaces and a single soft-silver icon color. The open line drawings have smooth curves, rounded corners, and a consistent stroke width. Its circular \"ig\" logo uses transparent lettering, while slightly lighter menus and gallery panels separate the controls from the image area."
  },
